  "fullDescription": "Hyperlinked daily, weekly and monthly pages for quick and easy navigation.\n\n• Undated so you can reuse it as many times as you want\n\nSimple and functional design for writing down and organizing your manifestations.\n\n_ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _\n\n✨ [ UNDATED VERSION ] ✨\n\nFILES INCLUDED IN YOUR PURCHASE:\n\n1 x Size Portrait Fully Hyperlinked and Functional Undated Digital Planner! ( 620 Pages PDF ).\n\nWHATS INCLUDED?\n\nDAILY, WEEKLY, MONTHLY PLANNER\n\n• Index- links to all pages.\n‌• Year at a glance.\n‌• 12 monthly calendar pages (jan-dec).\n‌• Weekly pages overview.\n‌• Daily pages.\n\nADDITIONAL PAGES:\n\n‌• Checklist.\n‌• Budget tracker.\n‌• Subscription tracker.\n•‌ Password tracker.\n‌• Self care planner.\n‌• Grocery shop list.\n‌• Meal planner.\n‌• Daily/weekly/monthly cleaning planner.\n‌• Gratitude journal.\n‌• 4 different style for note taking – (lined 2 versions), blank, graph.\n\n_ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _\n\n• It’s perfect for anyone who wants to stay organized and focused.\n\nThis planner is made with a sleek and user-friendly interface that allows you to easily navigate through your schedules and tasks with the help of thousands of hyperlinks.\n\nThe supported applications are:\n\nGoodNotes, Notability, Noteshelf, XODO, Samsung Notes, or any PDF editing app.\n\n🩷 Tas Creative Studio 🩷",
